# 默认按 LF 存入仓库，避免跨平台协作时出现整文件的无意义 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 上必须带 CRLF 的文件
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制，Git 不做换行转换也不做差异比较
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.7z binary
*.zip binary

# 测试媒体：必须按字节比较，不能被换行符转换破坏
src-tauri/tests/media/** binary
